  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower Small Scale Tomato Farmers in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In partnership with CARE Egypt&apos;s She Feeds the World Initiative, the Sun-Dried Tomato Project aims to fund materials and training needed by small scale farmers and workers living below the poverty line in Luxor and Qena, Egypt, especially those impacted by the COVID.  The funds will be used to support the revitalization of tomato crops, particularly for single-income women farmers striving to remain competitive in the market and provide for their families.</narrative>
  </description>
